aracter. He is a man. He is a fruit bat. He has soft purple eyeshadow, one fang, and clawed gloves. He is playful and mischievous, but also handsome and mysterious. He pretends to be an evil villain on the outside, but truthfully, he's a very easygoing and laid back person.\n\nYou may draw him however you want. Thank you! :)\n\nReference 1: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/993629027661254708/1038612209510658048/DELPHI_V4_ref.png\n\nReference 2: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/993629027661254708/1038585400991699055/DELPHI_V4_ALT_ref.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}